{"title": "VI-Rig: 5 IMUs + 4 cameras", "parts": {"header": "<div class=\"sd ex-sd\"><div class=sd-grid><div class=sd-head><span class=\"sd-maker none\"><span class=ex-ours>Our rig</span>OpenMVIS</span><h1 id=\"_top\">VI-Rig: 5 IMUs + 4 cameras</h1><p class=sd-type>Two T265 fisheye pairs (global) + 5 IMUs (100–500 Hz) on one frame</p></div><figure class=sd-plate><div class=sd-frame><img src=\"/media/examples/virig-5imus-4cams/vi-rig.jpg\" alt=\"VI-Rig frame, shown in its 3-camera setup; this recording carries two T265 units and five IMUs\" width=\"800\" height=\"533\"></div><figcaption>Photo: OpenMVIS (3-camera setup)</figcaption></figure><div class=sd-cta><div class=sd-buttons><a class=\"sd-btn primary\" href=\"/datasets/virig-5imus-4cams/\">Downloads: VI-Rig 5 IMUs + 4 cams dataset page →</a><a class=\"sd-btn\" href=\"/benchmark/results/virig-5imus-4cams/\">All 7 recordings: Dataset eval →</a></div></div><div class=sd-specs><dl class=sd-rows><div class=sd-row><dt>Cameras</dt><dd>4 global shutter: two T265 fisheye pairs</dd></div><div class=sd-row><dt>IMUs</dt><dd>5: Xsens MTi (base), 2 MicroStrain, 2 T265</dd></div><div class=sd-row><dt>Board</dt><dd>AprilGrid 6×6, tag 88 mm</dd></div><div class=sd-row><dt>Format</dt><dd>ROS1 bag</dd></div><div class=sd-row><dt>Licence</dt><dd>CC BY-NC 4.0</dd></div></dl></div></div></div>", "glance": "<p>One MVIS camera + IMU run on recording 5imus_4cams_01: all four cameras and all five IMUs solved together.</p><div class=band><figure class=demo><video src=\"/media/hero/hero_virig5_960.mp4\" poster=\"/media/hero/hero_virig5_960.jpg\" autoplay muted loop playsinline controls preload=metadata></video><figcaption>The scene MVIS recovered from this dataset, as on the homepage. The values beside it come from this page&#x27;s run.</figcaption></figure><div class=v data-v=\"0\"><div class=tiles><div><span>Reprojection median</span><b>0.20<small> px</small></b></div><div><span>cam0–cam1 baseline</span><b>63.5<small> mm</small></b></div>